		// caller as written: errors.go's useCompactErrors redacts every 5xx to
		// the status's generic reason phrase ("Service Unavailable"), so only
		// the server-side log (the redacted apiError's cause) sees this text —
		// a pre-existing, deliberate, codebase-wide policy this route does not
