	// present-and-non-empty branch must be a well-formed ref outside the
	// 'entire/' namespace. An empty string is the store's documented
	// clear-to-unlink sentinel (TrailMetadataUpdate.Branch), so it is exempt
	// here exactly as create exempts an absent/empty branch_name. A present but
	// WRONG-TYPE value (null, a number, ...) must 400 rather than silently
	// decode to "" and fall into the detach path — correctness fix: malformed
	// branch silently detaches (rawAsString's ok is only false for a genuinely
	// malformed value; a real explicit "" still detaches unchanged).
	if rawPresent(body.Branch) {
		branch, ok := rawAsString(body.Branch)
		if !ok {
